One of the things in nethack 3.1 that "annoys" me (not really) is when a
monster quaffs a potion of gain level.  Another is the monster who zaps
itself down a level everytime you get near it.  I was battling a nymph
who had stolen some items, including my skeleton key (one of my most used
tools) and she would just go down and down.  I decided not to follow her
after 4 levels, otherwise I'd get in big trouble.  I just hope the wand
runs out :-)

My best "frustration" with a monster getting the good potions was the
time a kobold lord open a potion and free a Djini (sp?)  I should have
gotten that potion and a wish.  I guess I should count my blessings.  The
kobold lord could have wished for Stormbringer :-)

